{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23434","headline":"元微之除浙东观察使喜得杭越邻州先赠长句 · 白居易","name":"元微之除浙东观察使喜得杭越邻州先赠长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"稽山镜水欢游地，犀带金章荣贵身。\n官职比君虽校小，封疆与我且爲邻。\n郡楼对翫千峰月，江界平分两岸春。\n杭越风光诗酒主，相看更合与何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}